	(descr "ASAIR / Aosong AHT20 humidity and temperature sensor, 3 x 3 x 1.0 mm, 6 pads 0.8 x 0.5 mm at 1.0 mm pitch, rows 2.0 mm apart (datasheet V1.0.03 figure 8). Rev B hand-solder pads: inner edge as the datasheet land (0.6 mm from centre), each pad extended 0.8 mm past the body so an iron can heat it outside the package. Each pad also has a 0.3 mm plated hole just under the body edge, for soldering from the back. Silk square at the top centre = the sensor window (pin 1 at top-left).")
